n flakyqueue","tags":["debug","pytest","determinism"],"status":"completed","created_at":"2026-08-31T18:31:10.427Z","body":"Completed. Fixed production nondeterminism in /workspace/in/flakyqueue/flakyqueue/scheduler.py by using injected clock/random dependencies and deterministic ready ordering; verified by direct test-function execution and repeated checks; wrote /workspace/out/root_cause.md."}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788201169972},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Noting pytest unavailability and path mapping issues**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_01f1371e534a58f8016a95c8d38c3087d2a8c7c0810089d76c\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Noting pytest unavailability and path mapping issues**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"Done.\n\nChanged:\n- `flakyqueue/scheduler.py`\n- wrote `out/root_cause.md`\n\nFixes:\n- `add()` now uses the injected clock once for both `created_at` and `run_at`\n- `ready()` now uses the injected clock\n- `schedule_retry()` now uses the injected clock and injected random source\n- removed the random shuffle\n- made ready-task ordering deterministic with:\n  - priority desc\n  - `run_at`\n  - `created_at`\n  - `id`\n\nWhy it was flaky:\n- code mixed injected deps with `time.time()` and `random.random()`\n- equal-priority tasks were shuffled before a stable sort, so tie order stayed random\n\nVerification:\n- `python3 -m pytest tests` could not run here because `pytest` is not installed in this env\n- ran the test functions directly: all passed\n- repeated the key deterministic checks 100 times: all passed\n\nFiles:\n- `/workspace/in/flakyqueue/flakyqueue/scheduler.py`\n- `/workspace/out/root_cause.md`","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_01f1371e534a58f8016a95c8d42cc887d293e460d9f69b3829\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt